The moments is a list of "23:59" and "00:00".
The minutes is an empty list of whole numbers.
For each moment in moments.
The hourpiece is the slice of moment from 0 to 2.
The minutepiece is the slice of moment from 3 to 5.
The firstdigit is the digit value of character 0 of hourpiece.
The seconddigit is the digit value of character 1 of hourpiece.
The hour is firstdigit times 10 plus seconddigit.
The thirddigit is the digit value of character 0 of minutepiece.
The fourthdigit is the digit value of character 1 of minutepiece.
The minute is thirddigit times 10 plus fourthdigit.
The total is hour times 60 plus minute.
Place total into minutes.

Sort minutes.
The last is the last position of minutes.
The closest is 1000000.
For every spot from 1 to last.
The earlier is item (spot minus 1) of minutes.
The later is item spot of minutes.
The gap is later minus earlier.
If gap is less than closest, set closest to gap.

The firsttime is item 0 of minutes.
The finaltime is item last of minutes.
The wrapped is firsttime plus 1440 minus finaltime.
If wrapped is less than closest, set closest to wrapped.
Show closest.
